			2008-10-20 
				changed namespace and schema location
				ns old		http://niem.gov/niem/external/ogc-openls/1.1.0/dhs-gmo/1.0.0
				ns new	http://niem.gov/niem/external/ogc/xls/1.1.0/dhs-gmo/2.1.0
				
